WEBVTT

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:18.750
Everyone safe?

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.750
We're okay!

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.380
It's so big!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.210
Looks extra strong, too!

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.210
That must be the Fire Dragon.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:39.920
I don't think we have anything to worry about yet,
but let me know if the situation changes.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.380
'Kay!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.080
What's the word on those two people you spotted?

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.290
They're headed for the Fire Dragon.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:20.000
Maa ikkatte ukenagashite

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.170
Nochi no jinsei wa henka shinakute

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.330
Mou ikka wa joushuu no te de

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:28.670
Boku no nouryoku wa imada sakanai

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:33.540
Katou tomosezu makeru koto mo itowanai nara

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:39.290
Mukishitsu na shinjou wa naze toki o utsu

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:45.500
Bokura dare mo ga himetaru chikara o motta monster

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:51.210
Da toshite mezame saseru koto naku ikitekuno

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:54.500
Oshikonde futa shite

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.250
Mou shinsen na kokoro janai

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:02.040
Sore demo kaoiro hitotsu kaezu ni ikiru monster

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:08.540
Dare mo ga mujikaku no sokojikara o uchi ni shinobaseru

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:12.250
Tsugi wa kimi no ban da

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:18.080
Tachimukaeyo monster

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.920
Seems the rumors weren't all talk.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:32.380
That thing's our target, then? Looks like fun.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.630
Sounds like they're after the Fire Dragon.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.460
Hey, hypothetically speaking,
if we can't pull this off, what do we do?

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.210
Don't worry about it.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:52.040
The guys from Ordarion
say this should go off without a hitch.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.580
Yeah? Guess that's good news.

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.500
"Ordarion"?

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.170
Must be some other city.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.580
What are they carrying in those barrels?

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.460
Spell Transfer - Magical Net!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.960
These two are no amateurs.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.750
A magic net, huh?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.420
Maybe it's some monster trap.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:27.330
Sure seemed a little too well-timed for that.

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.000
Might be some spell caster hanging 'round here.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.000
Maybe not.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.830
I'm telling you, it was just a trap.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.040
Let's go.

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:44.540
We'll try from behind next.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:49.580
Spell Transfer - Magical Net!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.170
Gotcha!

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.920
So they didn't actually let their guard down...

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.540
I figured as much.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.960
Spell Transfer - Magical Net!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.790
Now that was a point of surprise!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.790
What is this thing? I can't move!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.670
Who did this?

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.710
What's with all these slimes?

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:33.250
Must be that tamer.
I thought he was dropped off the list...

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.670
Looks like this is it.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.170
"Cleanse this tainted world!"

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:53.710
What happened?

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.540
We didn't even do anything.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.000
They were with the Blue Moon of Salvation.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.330
Slimes, take a look at those barrels.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.290
You got it!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.330
Coming right up!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.040
What's with these things?

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.080
I must say they seem quite perturbing.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:14.330
Are they anything like those
cursed magic stones we found?

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.750
Now that you mention it, yeah!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:18.880
Better ask a pro.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.080
This water is cursed.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:43.380
It's not nearly as strong as the magic stones, and
wouldn't be nearly enough to defeat a Fire Dragon, but...

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:47.330
But an awful curse like this
would certainly get its temper flaring.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.330
So they were going to use it on the Fire Dragon.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.000
Best get that water purified for now.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.750
Spell Transfer - Dispel Curse - Extreme!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.080
It's nice, clean water now!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.790
Nice going!

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.790
That's one less thing to worry about.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:14.540
I'm off to the woods again, then.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.250
Send word if you need anything.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.040
Will do. Thanks.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:31.500
Bye-bye!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.040
All right. I want you all to keep lookout.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.330
We've quite a herd of Lesser Fire Dragons!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.920
What's their deal?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.750
Something's definitely up.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.920
Sir! Please open up!

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.130
Something wrong?

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.750
You need to head for safety.
Rain could fall at any moment.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.210
Mommy, I'm scared!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.380
The rain clouds have opened up!

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:19.420
We gotta hurry!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.330
Look! The Fire Dragon is furious!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:54.960
The Fire Dragon never awakens in rainy times like these.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.330
Never, save for just one time...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.500
Yuji! Bad news!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:15.460
The Fire Dragon is headed in your direction!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.000
There's that herd again.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.750
The rain is hurting them!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:38.960
Half a century ago,
the Fire Dragon emerged during a storm.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:46.670
Enraged by the rain, the Fire Dragon
bathed all of Boginia in flames.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.130
Everyone move along to safety!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:07.960
Let's stay calm, now!

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.420
This town's done for.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.710
I need to do something to stop it.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:30.080
There are two rivers between that dragon and the town.
If it really hates water, then...

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.710
Proud Wolf. I want you to head for that first river.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.790
I want to see if the dragon will stop at its waters.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.420
Roger that!

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.330
There it goes!

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:52.330
Look at the size of that thing!

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.290
The very river itself appears to be evaporating!

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.500
Sure is getting hot 'round here.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.380
The Fire Dragon's moving toward the river!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.290
What'll it be? Will it stop?

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:31.380
Hard to ascertain anything in this fog.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.540
I didn't ask for a sauna!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:38.330
It only took a couple dozen liters of water
to take down the Lesser Fire Dragons.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:42.580
Infinitely more water runs through that river, yet still...

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.210
It doesn't even look fazed!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.710
It's making for the second river now!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.750
Not planning to stop, huh?

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.710
So be it.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.670
Slimes, we're going to fight this dragon.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:10.670
You ready?

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:12.170
'Course we are!

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.830
Ready and awaiting orders!

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.080
Let's do this!

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:18.960
Hup!

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.290
Hiyah!

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:27.130
What magnificent speed!

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.500
All thanks to this sweet new armor!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:42.330
Spell Transfer - Ranged Frost - Medium!

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:51.210
That was even stronger than last time!

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:52.830
Let's keep up the attack!

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:00.880
If that didn't work...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.920
Spell Transfer - Ranged Frost - Medium - times 10!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:13.500
I think we did it!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.130
Nothing's working...

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.130
There's no way!

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:27.540
We're not done yet.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:29.790
Spell Transfer...

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:34.420
Ranged Frost - Medium - times 20!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.000
It's too dangerous to draw out this fight any longer.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.290
Proud Wolf, fall back to the second river.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.880
S-sure thing....

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.670
If it doesn't stop here...

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.830
The town will certainly meet its demise!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:31.460
No, you saved us enough time.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.960
M-meaning what, exactly?

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:35.630
This is the moment I was waiting for.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:36.960
Here goes.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.130
Roger that!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.420
Release Barrier!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.080
Look at that!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.960
When did you hatch this plan?

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:13.420
I set up a barrier dam
once it reached the first river, just to be safe.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:19.830
You guys held it back long enough
for us to get plenty of water ready here.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.630
What a plan!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.960
Way to go!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.460
Did it work?

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.420
I'll go scope things out!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.080
Be careful.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:38.080
It's down!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.330
Yippee!

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.080
Brains over brawn!

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:52.210
Huh?

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:53.920
That was close.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.710
Get away from that Fire Dragon, now!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.420
Don't need to tell me twice!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.960
That fireball is bigger than ever!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:13.500
This cannot be good.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:16.380
Is it going to burn down the whole town?

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.540
This will use up a lot of MP...

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.540
Ice Magic

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.540
Ranged Frost

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.540
Freeze Blast

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.540
Frost Barrier

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.540
Permafrost Curse

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.790
But I still have that Mana Restorative.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.630
Yuji

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.630
Class: Tamer, Sage

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.630
Skills: Taming, Holy Magic, Dark Magic, Fire Magic, Water Magic, Earth Magic, Lightning Magic,

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.630
Wind Magic, Time Magic, Special Magic, Grand Magic, Familiar Magic, Buff Magic,

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.630
Modification Magic, Master-class Combat Skills

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.630
Type: None

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:31.460
Spell Transfer - Permafrost Curse!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.330
Whoa! You really beat it this time!

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.710
Hooray!

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.250
That was so cool!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.920
We did it!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.790
Look, the rain stopped, too!

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:55.170
Sense Share

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.750
Is that a Fire Dragon jewel?

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.080
Looks pretty hefty.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.790
Yuji.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.330
Something wrong?

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.040
We found some weird thing out here.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.750
What IS that?

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.630
Beats me.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.330
The tamer's back!

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:26.880
That Fire Dragon sure stirred this place up some.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.920
Can't complain now that the place is safe, though.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.290
Yeah...

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.960
So? What brings you back?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.540
I got my hands on a rare sort of jewel.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.040
It's huge!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.790
Wait a minute, did you...?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.380
Let's call it a big Lesser Fire Dragon jewel.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.540
Is it really, though?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:53.000
Use that brain of yours! 'Course it ain't!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:57.290
You can't get something like that
from a Lesser, only from a...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:03.250
But sure, a big Lesser, then.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.500
You'll be wanting some armor, then?

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:10.040
If you could.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.960
Sure can. I'll fix up something you're gonna love.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.290
Can I ask you something?

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:22.210
Have you ever heard of a town called Ordarion?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:26.500
Of course. But it's not a favored spot among adventurers.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:27.960
Why not?

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.630
It's a peculiar sort of place.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:36.500
One that values its privacy and doesn't like
to be bothered by other towns and regions.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.210
Mind if I ask you something else?

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.380
Any idea what this is?

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.290
Wh-where did you get this?

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.880
Found it up on the volcano.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.830
This is one of the Guild's artificial rain machines.

00:18:58.130 --> 00:18:59.540
Artificial rain?

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.670
This thing can make changes to the weather?

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:08.500
Exactly. We use them during times of drought.
Almost every town's guild has one.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.330
The Guild...

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:15.040
Hmm, the name of the guild this belongs to is missing.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:18.040
I wonder where this came from...

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:27.420
The guys from Ordarion say
this should go off without a hitch.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.250
Ordarion... The Guild... Who set this up?

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:46.790
Not to sing my own praise,
but that's legendary level armor right there.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:50.330
Thanks. Let's give it a try.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.500
You'd better not.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.040
It's not safe here.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.330
Right. I'll be careful with it.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:19:59.790
Hey, now.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:04.040
Still don't plan on telling me your name?

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:07.290
I'm trying to keep a low profile.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.330
That so, eh?

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.250
Careful out there on the road.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:14.330
Thanks.

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:19.170
Master, what was that all about?

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.290
Forget it, get back to work!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.210
Move it!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.670
May demise fall upon this tainted world...

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.750
May the light engulf the world in flames...

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:46.080
And the shadow of the moon pull all into darkness...

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:51.000
Divine powers that be, lend me your strength!

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:08.250
Your revelation is heard...

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:15.830
With death is born the sage.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:42.040
EPISODE 9

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:42.040
WE FOUGHT A FIRE DRAGON

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.750
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.790
Tansaku mo choutatsu mo ote no mono

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.170
"Tomodachi takusan tsukretekita yo!"

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:52.880
Machi made ato ippo no toko de encount

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:54.290
"Haa kufuku de! Chikara ga nee!"

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.750
"Kibichii mamono ga jiirojiro!"

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.210
"Maji panee! Maji panee!"

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:02.330
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:59.420
"Fumu, koko wa okunote shika nai desuzo...!"

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.040
"Sonnano attakke?"

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.330
"Niigerun da yo!"

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:06.540
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta

00:22:07.670 --> 00:22:11.960
Zenmetsu suru to wa nani goto ka!

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:19.830
Yuushatachi yo tachiagare!

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.250
"Karyoku infure zoukyouyaku"

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:22.420
"Kameba kamu hodo chou kaifuku"

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:25.330
Tsuyomi ga tsuyomi ga deruzo

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:28.330
Happadayo!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:28.330
"Itadaitokimashou!"

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:30.670
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:37.170
Youyaku aritsuketa gohan ga oishii ne!

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:39.920
Doukutsu demo mayoi no mori demo

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:42.920
Aa manpuku manzoku shizen no baikingu

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:47.960
Onaka ga suite wa ikusa ga dekinai ne!

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:53.130
Ikuzo gattai kougekida! Tobikiri magical tsuyoi yatsu

00:22:53.210 --> 00:22:56.210
Chi o saki hi wo fuke!

00:22:56.210 --> 00:22:57.630
"Hyakuninriki no kyuukyoku mahou da!"

00:22:57.630 --> 00:22:59.000
"Maryoku to cheat no housekibako da!"

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.420
"Shuuen no gouka de ichimoudajin da!"

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:03.210
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:05.830
CHEST!

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:08.330
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:10.670
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:14.880
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:16.830
Yay! We beat the dragon!

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:17.750
It was so strong!

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.170
But our Yuji prevails!

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:20.580
But after all that...

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:21.790
Let's take a little break!

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:22.710
No objections here!

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:24.420
Let's nom on some meat first, though!

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:25.170
Count me in!

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:27.170
Wait, our meat is missing!

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:28.250
Wha-?! It is?!

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:29.960
This is no laughing matter!

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:31.460
What are we gonna do?

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:34.330
Bad news! We got baddies!

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:36.250
No time for that now!

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:38.750
"Didn't seem like a good time for that!"

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:42.040
DIDN'T SEEM LIKE A GOOD TIME FOR THAT

00:23:39.170 --> 00:23:40.290
Our meat!
